# night-school palette (original to this project)
# v2 (2026-11-22): the "night school x occult" bridge palette of the ARCANUM XXII
# pixel works. The first 20 keys are the original ones (N U u M C unchanged, the
# rest retuned a little); 9 keys were added for the occult side and for finer
# plaster, wood and skin ramps. Every swap palette must carry all 29 keys.
# KEY  RRGGBB  name / use
K 0b0810 outline, deepest shadow, void
D 1a1424 night indigo-violet
N 2b2b40 navy shadow
U 3a4466 uniform blue
u 56638a uniform light
M 8798b8 moonlight blue-grey
W c4bdaa pale plaster
w ece6d4 white highlight, paper
G 343f39 wainscot dark green
g 4f5d53 wainscot green
p 45301f wood dark
P 6e4c34 wood
s e3b08c skin
h b0765e skin shadow
H 231c22 hair
R c42e38 accent red, danger
r 6a1824 dried blood
Y f2c86a light, flashlight
C 7fe0d0 spirit cyan
c 2f8a8a spirit cyan dark
S 2e1c36 occult shade
V 4e2e52 bruise violet
m 7e4c70 rose
n 5a5249 plaster deep shadow
b 8f8778 plaster shadow
o 93683f wood light
q 6a4656 skin deep shadow
O e07a34 candle flame
L fff1c4 flame core
